      "content": "hey, i need help with something weirdly specific. i've been seeing these patterns everywhere lately and i can't explain them. today i kept seeing 11:11 on every single clock i passed, then i went to a cafe and the total on my receipt was exactly $11.11, and then i run into a guy named Leo—which is the name of my childhood pet—and it all happened right after i spent the morning focusing really hard on my new business idea. \n\ncan you help me calculate the probability of all this actually happening in one morning? it feels way too specific to be just random.",
